```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Compute
        Backend["Backend Spring Boot\n/api/enrollment, /api/admin/devices\nJava 25"]
        Gateway["Node-RED Gateway\nIoT message routing\nNode-RED"]
    end

    subgraph Data["Data & State"]
        Postgres["PostgreSQL\nDevice registry, audit, VCs"]
        Redis["Redis\nNonce cache, device cache, session data"]
    end

    Gateway -->|HTTP API calls| Backend
    Backend -->|persist device state| Postgres
    Backend -->|cache nonces and device sessions| Redis
    Gateway -->|lookup device status| Redis
